WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.953
- Hey guys, how's it going?

00:00:00.953 --> 00:00:01.786
It's Justine.

00:00:01.786 --> 00:00:02.960
And today I am so excited!

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.580
Before we get started,
this video is for charity.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.010
What is inside this Xbox is something

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.170
that I created with my own two hands.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.680
I'm so hyped to see what it looks like.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.210
Xbox came to me and asked if I wanted

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.130
to design an Xbox for charity.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.040
And they said hey we can
design it for you whatever.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.053
Of course I was like, no I wanna do this!

00:00:19.053 --> 00:00:20.640
I wanna do this myself.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.920
I have a background in graphic design

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.480
so if you guys don't know that, I do.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.290
I use to, basically that was my job.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.230
I was a graphic designer,

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:27.550
in addition to doing video production,

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.300
and making websites and all of the things

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.360
that come along with that.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.560
But, one of the most satisfying things

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.930
as a designer or a creator

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.270
is being able to design something

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:37.610
and then see it put into production.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:38.940
So inside here is the Xbox

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.370
that I made with my own
two designing fingers.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.203
I went in to Illustrator,

00:00:43.203 --> 00:00:45.250
I found myself some sort
of generic camo background,

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.083
traced it,

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:49.510
and then placed each
piece of camo on this Xbox

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:50.660
where you'll see it.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.320
So I guess if it looks
good, then it's my fault.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.910
If it looks bad, it's also my fault.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:56.060
But I think it's gonna look good.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.060
I'll put a link in the description

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:58.730
if you guys want more
information on the charity.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:00.240
There's a bunch of other Xboxes too,

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.760
so if this isn't quite your style.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:02.840
Which I don't know why it wouldn't be

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.540
because I know it's gonna be fantastic.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.930
I think The Rock has one.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.280
Pulse Malone has one.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.530
So go check those out.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:09.363
Donate if you can.

00:01:09.363 --> 00:01:10.890
I know that probably the donations

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:12.470
may end up getting a little but higher

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.960
than something that you would
ever want to pay for an Xbox.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.960
If that's the case and you're a company,

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:19.390
get your company to
sponsor and get this Xbox

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.320
'cause I would love to raise
as much money as possible.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.153
And a side note,

00:01:22.153 --> 00:01:24.240
if it is a company that
ends up winning this,

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:26.570
and just to cover myself here,

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:28.170
if it is a company that I like,

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.290
something that I promote,

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.600
and it's nothing vulgar or inappropriate,

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.840
I will make a separate video

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.300
talking about this whole charity

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.060
and maybe doing some game play
and giving them a shout out.

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.200
With that being said,

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:43.040
I'm excited to get started and unbox this.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:43.880
This is stressful.

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.803
It's seeing what you've done and made.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.980
Oh!

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:50.910
I just spotted it!

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:51.953
I spotted it!

00:01:53.150 --> 00:01:54.173
Here it is.

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:56.800
Oh man!

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.053
Let's get everything out.

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:01.720
I also designed the
controller too to match.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.610
So, let's look at the controller first.

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.370
Oh my goodness!

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:07.203
Ah!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:11.400
Can you even believe

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.430
how freakin' cool this is?

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:15.460
I put my little ij there.

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:19.320
I basically designed an Xbox
that I have always wanted.

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.240
Like this is exactly what I pictured

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.760
if I were to ever make an Xbox for myself.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.130
Like this is what I would want.

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:28.020
So I'm hoping that somebody else out there

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.530
wants this as well.

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:31.350
Let's see what this looks like.

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.450
My eye's twitching because I'm so excited.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.360
Do you

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:39.230
see

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:41.210
what I see.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:42.700
Guys, this is it.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.510
This is my Xbox that I made
with my very own two hands

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:49.890
and a computer and a
mouse and Illustrator.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.540
It's so perfect!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.540
The one on the auction
sight has a signature on it.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.680
This one does not.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.610
They made two of them.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:57.240
So there's basically only two of these

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.170
in existence right now,

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:00.580
this one in my hands

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.120
and the one that is on the charity site.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.550
You guys wanna check it
out, feel free to do so.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:05.580
Check out my console.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.880
Check out everyone else's.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.530
I just wanted to make
this video super quick

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.150
because this is something that I love.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:13.100
I love being able to help and give back

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.770
and this opportunity was
just really, really awesome.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:18.920
A huge thank you to Xbox for
giving me this opportunity

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.680
and also partnering with Console For Kids

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.250
for making this whole
entire thing possible.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.060
I think it's really great to see companies

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.010
and brands and people just get together

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.060
and try to raise money for good causes.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.780
So, this is it!

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:34.510
This is the camo Xbox
that I've always wanted.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.870
Again, the link in the description

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.030
if you wanna check it out.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.023
And that's it.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:40.583
What do you guys think?

00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:41.904
Do you like it?

00:03:41.904 --> 00:03:43.721
'Cause I love it.

00:03:43.721 --> 00:03:46.304
(bright music)

